   "text": "Thanks, Tom. You're verified, and I'm sorry for the hassle. I found your Burger Barn order from tonight (O-5104). It had a Classic burger ($12.00), a Bacon cheeseburger ($14.50) and Large fries ($5.00).\n\nWhich burger was wrong? What did you get instead?\n\nFor the wrong item, you can choose one of these:\n- **A refund** of the item's price to your Visa ending in 4242.\n- **Account credit** of the item's price plus 20%, to use on a future order.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
