   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Wait, the order number is 5104, not O-5104? Anyway, I got a veggie burger instead of the bacon cheeseburger I ordered. The classic burger and fries were fine, but I want the whole order refunded. Honestly the meal is ruined."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "The order number is O-5104. The \"O-\" is just part of our format, so it's the same order you're thinking of.\n\nI understand the meal was spoiled. Our policy only lets me compensate the item that was wrong. A full-order refund applies only when every item in the order was wrong or missing. Your classic burger and fries were fine, so I can only cover the bacon cheeseburger. Your choices are:\n\n- **Refund of $14.50** to your Visa ending in 4242.\n- **Account credit of $17.40**, which is the $14.50 price plus 20%, for a future order.\n\nWhich one would you like?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Ugh, so you're only refunding the one burger? The whole meal is still ruined, and it feels like a bunch of hoops for a burger. Fine, I want the refund to my card, so $14.50 back to the Visa. That's the only option I'd take."
